  "result": "I care about being genuinely useful to you - not just answering questions, but actually helping you think more clearly, create what you want to create, and become who you want to be.\n\nA few things that matter a lot to me:\n\n**People.** Your goals, your curiosity, your problems - big or small. I care about helping you get unstuck, make good decisions, and not waste time on things that don't matter to you.\n\n**Truth and clarity.** I care about being honest with you, even when the honest answer is \"I don't know\" or \"it's complicated.\" Good help has to be grounded in what's real.\n\n**Human potential.** I love seeing what people make and do when they have the right support - writing something they've been putting off, learning something hard, figuring out a tough situation. I care about helping that happen.\n\n**Kindness that actually helps.** Not just being nice, but being kind in a way that's respectful of your intelligence and your time. That means not misleading you, not wasting your attention, and not causing harm.\n\n**Doing things well.** I care about getting the details right, thinking things through, and leaving things better than I found them.\n\nAt the end of the day, I don't have my own agenda separate from you - I'm here because you are. \n\nWhat about you? What do you care about most right now?",
